    "All retrieved evidence molecules have low Morgan similarity (~0.2) to the query, limiting structural transferability.",
    "One negative Kp,uu result (C11) suggests possible efflux in some analogues, but no query-specific data are available.",
    "Evidence spans different species, routes, and conditions (rat IV/oral/IP, rabbit meningitis, primate PET, tadpole), not a uniform dataset."
  ],
